  "question": {
    "text": "The mean and variance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math> respetively. If two observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the variance of the remaining <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math> observations is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>92</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>",
